Any idea what it means?

MWE:

\RequirePackage[patch]{kvoptions}
\documentclass{DissOnlineLatex}
%\usepackage[ngerman]{babel}
\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}
\usepackage{lscape}
\usepackage{setspace}
\usepackage[style=chem-angew,backend=bibtex8,]{biblatex}
